TEST 13563 -- QoS: CoS - Specify CoS
===========================================================================
Run: 2026-09-22 09:51:52  tb470
CoS lives in the 802.1Q header, so the ingress port must accept TAGGED
frames -- port2.0.2 is put into trunk mode for this case only.

configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
IE520-stk(config)#interface port2.0.2
IE520-stk(config-if)#switchport mode trunk
IE520-stk(config-if)#switchport trunk allowed vlan add 1
IE520-stk(config-if)#switchport trunk native vlan 1
IE520-stk(config-if)#exit
IE520-stk(config)#end
